        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void wolfSSL_free_psa_ctx</definition>
        <argsstring>(struct psa_ssl_ctx *ctx)</argsstring>
        <name>wolfSSL_free_psa_ctx</name>
        <param>
          <type>struct psa_ssl_ctx *</type>
          <declname>ctx</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>この関数はPSAコンテキストによって使用されるリソースを解放します </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function releases the resources used by a PSA context.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__PSA_1ga69aa2e5f10a1493bffeb51993ef4b09b" kindref="member">wolfSSL_set_psa_ctx</ref></para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>ctx</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>pointer to a struct psa_ssl_ctx</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__PSA_1ga69aa2e5f10a1493bffeb51993ef4b09b" kindref="member">wolfSSL_set_psa_ctx</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
